ouvelle preuve aux formules donnant les permutations connexes selon leur nombre et aussi selon leur nombre de cycles. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProof of a Conjecture of Reiner-Tenner-Yong on Barely Set-valued Tableaux (https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.08292)\nciteturn1academia14 [wordlim: 200] Published: 8.3 years ago; Title: Proof of a Conjecture of Reiner-Tenner-Yong on Barely Set-valued Tableaux ... In the case when $\\lambda$ is a rectangular staircase partition $\\delta_d(b^a)$, Reiner, Tenner and Yong conjectured that $|{\\mathrm{BSSYT}}(\\lambda,k)|= \\frac{kab(d-1)}{(a+b)} |{\\mathrm{SYT}}(\\lambda,k)|$.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n(PDF) Symmetry of Narayana numbers and rowvacuation of root posets (https://www.researchgate.net/publication/348321262_Symmetry_of_Narayana_numbers_and_rowvacuation_of_root_posets)\nciteturn1search10 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.8 years ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; where Krew : NC(W)→NC(W) denotes the Kreweras complement deﬁned by ... shev’s Conjecture 1.2.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSymmetry of Narayana Numbers and Rowvacuation of Root Posets | Forum of Mathematics, Sigma | Cambridge Core (https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/forum-of-mathematics-sigma/article/symmetry-of-narayana-numbers-and-rowvacuation-of-root-posets/786F8F012E6153C711868DE147A493C0)\nciteturn1search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.3 years ago; Crawled: 3 months ago; Armstrong, Stump and Thomas [Reference Armstrong, Stump and Thomas2] proved this conjecture of Bessis and Reiner by defining an explicit bijection between Image $\\mathcal {A}(\\Phi ^+)$ and Image $\\operatorname {\\mathrm {NC}}(W,c)$ that equivariantly maps rowmotion to Kreweras complement.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPromotion and rowmotion in rational Catalan combinatorics (